UID:ironman-703-boulder-2026@milehighrunners.com
DTSTAMP:20260531T000000Z
DTSTART:20260613T080000Z
DTEND:20260613T120000Z
SUMMARY:IRONMAN 70.3 Boulder
DESCRIPTION:IRONMAN 70.3 Boulder is set against the backdrop of the iconic Flatirons and the towering Rockies. The course features a reservoir swim\, hilly bike\, and hilly run at high elevation. Air temperatures range from 61–79°F with an average water temp of 71°F. The race invites athletes to rise to the challenge of rolling terrain and a community that lives and breathes endurance. Registration is now open.
LOCATION:Boulder\, CO\, United States
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
