BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:leadville-trail-marathon-heavy-half-2026@milehighrunners.com
DTSTAMP:20260531T000000Z
DTSTART:20260627T063000Z
DTEND:20260627T103000Z
SUMMARY:Leadville Trail Marathon & Heavy Half
DESCRIPTION:The Life Time Leadville Trail Marathon and Heavy Half presented by La Sportiva takes trail runners through the historic mining district's challenging trails to the highest point of any Leadville Race Series event: Mosquito Pass (13\,185 feet). The marathon covers 26.4 miles of out-and-back dirt roads and single track\, while the Heavy Half covers 15.46 miles along the same path minus the Ball Mountain section. General Registration is SOLD OUT; waitlist available. Marathon starts at 6:30 AM and Heavy Half starts at 9:00 AM on race day.
LOCATION:135 E. 6th Street\, Leadville\, CO 80461
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
