BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:hardrock-100-2026@milehighrunners.com
DTSTAMP:20260531T000000Z
DTSTART:20260710T060000Z
DTEND:20260710T100000Z
SUMMARY:Hardrock 100
DESCRIPTION:The Hardrock Hundred Mile Endurance Run is a 100-mile ultramarathon held in the San Juan Mountains of Colorado. The course features 33\,264 feet of climb and 33\,264 feet of descent for a total elevation change of 66\,528 feet\, with an average elevation of 11\,186 feet\, a low point of 7\,680 feet (Ouray)\, and a high point of 14\,048 feet (Handies Peak). The 2026 edition runs clockwise (CW) starting at 6:00 AM on July 10\, 2026 in Silverton\, Colorado.
LOCATION:Silverton\, Colorado
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:hardrock-hundred-mile-endurance-run-2026@milehighrunners.com
DTSTAMP:20260531T000000Z
DTSTART:20260710T060000Z
DTEND:20260710T100000Z
SUMMARY:Hardrock Hundred Mile Endurance Run
DESCRIPTION:A legendary ultra-mountain race through the San Juan Mountains\, featuring over 33\,000 feet of elevation gain. The course connects Silverton\, Lake City\, Ouray\, and Telluride\, and famously requires finishers to 'kiss the hardrock' at the finish line.
LOCATION:Silverton School\, 1160 Blair St\, Silverton\, CO 81433
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
