DESCRIPTION:Diplo's Run Club returns to Denver for its third season at Cheesman Park. This 5K run takes participants through one of Denver's most iconic and historic neighborhoods before returning to the park for the finish. After the run\, enjoy a post-race concert festival featuring Diplo + friends. Packet pick-up is on Saturday\, July 11 (time & venue TBC). VIP packet pick-up begins at 7:00 AM on race day\, with the start line DJ at 8:00 AM and race start at 9:00 AM. The festival opens at 9:00 AM\, with an opener DJ at 10:00 AM and Diplo performing at 11:00 AM.
